WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:06.880
How can we overtake smoothly and save
energy? A faster car is now passing close
by, on the right.

2
00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:13.880
The button sets the overtaking goal. The
instruction asks for smoothness and energy
efficiency.

3
00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:23.880
Both candidates overtake. A finishes
earlier, at higher predicted energy. B
allows more time.

4
00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:28.880
The comparison favors B.

5
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:34.880
Another offer accepted: twenty-six seconds;
four-point-five seconds per transition.

6
00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:40.880
Both evaluations yield a new plan:
twenty-nine seconds; four-point-five-second
transitions.

7
00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:44.880
Goal retained. Ego changes into the right
lane.

8
00:00:45.120 --> 00:00:49.880
Ego continues forward in the target lane
and gradually passes the slower lead car.

9
00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:54.880
Back to the original lane. Solid lines show
execution.

10
00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:59.880
Completed. Recorded model energy: about
fifty-seven watt-hours.
